.env.local

### Windows ###
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
*.stackdump
[Dd]esktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.cab
*.msi
*.msix
*.msm
*.msp
*.lnk

# Local artifacts
.zcode/
/android-screen.png
/design-todos-apple.png

# Fumadocs MDX codegen + generated LLM endpoints (regenerated on dev/build)
apps/tauri-app/.source/
apps/tauri-app/public/docs.txt
apps/tauri-app/public/docs/
apps/tauri-app/public/llms.txt
apps/tauri-app/public/llms-full.txt
apps/tauri-app/public/agent/

# Generated skill adapters (regenerated by .agents/scripts/skill.sh)
.claude/skills/
.cursor/rules/*.generated.mdc
.cursor/commands/*.generated.md

# Inspecto user-specific overrides; shared defaults live in .inspecto/settings.json
.inspecto/settings.local.json
.inspecto/prompts.local.json

# ND Workflow adoption recovery journal (private project text) and index cache
.nd-workflow-adoption/
.nd-cache/
.context-index/
# Paired-run evaluation checkouts (throwaway worktrees)
.eval-wt/

# Benchmark arms commit substrate only — the UI layer is written by the agent under test,
# so a run's produced files are archived under apps/benchmark/results/ instead of tracked in place.
apps/benchmark/*/src/app.tsx
apps/benchmark/*/src/components.tsx
apps/benchmark/*/dist/
